# The WebGPU CTS queries for the API areas the binding layer relies on: adapter and device requests with features and
# limits, error scopes and uncaptured errors, device loss, buffer creation and mapping, labels, queue writes and work
# completion, the content-timeline checks of texture, view and query-set creation and of setBindGroup and
# setImmediates, and basic compute, copy and render work. One query per line; `#` starts a comment.

